Diet Planning Assistant - Upgraded Streaming Logic Module (logic.py)
This updated version of logic.py implements the stream_response generator method, allowing the chatbot to stream responses chunk-by-chunk in real time using LangChain's .stream() method.

Key Changes & New Features
Streaming Generator (stream_response):

Declared as a generator returning Generator[str, None, None].

Appends the user message to history immediately.

Replaces .invoke() with self.model.stream(...) to keep the connection open and yield text chunks as they arrive.

Accumulates chunks into response_content and saves the complete AI response to SQLite history once streaming finishes.

